# Step 25: full screen, the session interface and onboarding. Its rules,
# broken one at a time, with the tests that must fail. Written with the
# code (docs/steps/25/answered.md, "The design, before building").

[break] full-redraws-every-row
rule: The full-screen presenter writes only the rows that changed since the last frame.
